WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.103
Meet Multi Search Hub: one starting point for a broader search.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:07.000
Open the search window and enter your topic.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.983
Pick a built-in group, then choose the sources you want to

00:00:10.983 --> 00:00:14.966
include. Search the web, images, or videos without retyping your
question

00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:18.950
on every site. Compatible sources can appear in a combined
results

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.933
view. Other sources open in their own tabs, so you can

00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:26.916
explore them directly. Switch between list and card layouts, and
choose

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:29.089
the theme that works for you.

00:00:29.089 --> 00:00:33.072
The free edition includes built-in groups and up to fifteen
results

00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:36.693
per engine, with sixty results total in the combined view.

00:00:36.693 --> 00:00:40.676
Pro adds custom engines and groups, saved presets, search
history, backup

00:00:40.676 --> 00:00:42.849
and restore, and encrypted saved sign-ins.

00:00:42.849 --> 00:00:45.746
Pro is a one-time purchase, not a subscription.

00:00:45.746 --> 00:00:49.729
Start free in Chrome or Edge, then upgrade if those extra

00:00:49.729 --> 00:00:51.902
tools fit the way you work.

00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:55.885
Visit multi search hub dot github dot io for store links,

00:00:55.885 --> 00:00:58.058
feature comparisons, and the user guides.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.506
Search once. Explore more.
